diff --git a/CHANGES.rst b/CHANGES.rst
index feab627..6a8a6e7 100644
--- a/CHANGES.rst
+++ b/CHANGES.rst
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@ Version 2.0.0
 Unreleased
 
 -   Drop support for Python 2 and 3.5.
+-   Reject signatures with future timestamps when validating ``max_age``
+    by raising ``SignatureExpired``.
 -   ``datetime`` values are timezone-aware with ``timezone.utc``. Code
     using ``TimestampSigner.unsign(return_timestamp=True)`` or
     ``BadTimeSignature.date_signed`` may need to change. :issue:`150`
